### 1. Testar CPF com tamanho incorreto (Deve retornar erro 400)
POST http://localhost:3000/funcionario/cadastrar
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "codFuncionario": "1",
    "nome": "eliel",
    "email": "eliel@gmail.com",
    "senha": "123",
    "cpf": "12345",
}

### 2. Testar CPF com tamanho correto 
POST http://localhost:3000/funcionario/cadastrar
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "codFuncionario": "1",
    "nome": "eliel",
    "email": "eliel@gmail.com",
    "senha": "123",
    "cpf": "123.456.789-01",
}


